      ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=\\tan x?$ Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The zeros of the function are exactly $x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+n\\pi.$\n- **II.** The vertical asymptotes are exactly $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+n\\pi.$\n- **III.** The range of the function is $[-1,1].$",
